msgctxt "112"
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "Cos'è questo posto?"

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"It used to be a restaurant I ran for the yakuza. Called it\r\n"
"Kamurocho Castle. Hasn't been a restaurant for a long\r\n"
"time now, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Now it serves as the headquarters for the Honest Living\r\n"
"Association⑬the HLA. I'm their representative."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Honest Living Association? What's that all about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"The HLA is an organization that helps former yakuza members\r\n"
"get out of the \"business\" and start making an honest living."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"We do things like help them find work, give them\r\n"
"low-interest loans if they need them, things like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"At first, we used my house for the HLA headquarters, but a\r\n"
"lot of our members needed a place to stay, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"So we converted my restaurant into our dormitory and\r\n"
"headquarters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"The \"castle dungeon\" look comes from the theming of the\r\n"
"original restaurant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"HLA members say it kind of looks like a prison, so it helps\r\n"
"keep them on the straight and narrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"I guess it's been a contributing factor in rehabilitating\r\n"
"our members back into normal society."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Interesting. Never knew a place like this existed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Yes, sir. We've tried to keep it under wraps, so I'd guess\r\n"
"most Tojo Clan members have never heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Who founded the HLA?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "...Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "What? Kashiwagi-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"It's hard for people who leave the yakuza to make their way\r\n"
"out and try to earn an honest living in the outside world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Kashiwagi-san knew this and saw how much these guys were\r\n"
"suffering. That's why he set up the HLA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"He was a well-respected man who always took good care of\r\n"
"his men, so even former yakuza members came to him with\r\n"
"their problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"They'd all tell him that leaving the business was fine and\r\n"
"all, but that trying to make it in normal society was\r\n"
"next to impossible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Yeah, knowing what kind of guy Kashiwagi-san was, I'm sure\r\n"
"he lent them a sympathetic ear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"To Kashiwagi-san, they were still members of his family,\r\n"
"even though they'd already left the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Kashiwagi-san founded the HLA as an organization that could\r\n"
"provide these people with the support they needed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Is that right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"Recently, as the Tojo Clan was becoming more turbulent,\r\n"
"Kashiwagi-san turned over the management of the HLA to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"He asked me to watch over our members until they could\r\n"
"support themselves through honest work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"Now that Kashiwagi-san is no longer with us... it's my\r\n"
"duty to fulfill his dying wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Yeah, I can understand that."
msgstr "Eh sì, lo capisco."

msgctxt "472"
msgid "But now the HLA is facing a serious problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "That guy from before, you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Yeah. He's a former member who got help from us once..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"But somebody's given him orders to hurt the members\r\n"
"of the HLA and the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Why would someone do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"And it's not just him. More and more former yakuza are\r\n"
"carrying out these kinds of attacks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"They call themselves the \"Reapers,\" and they've obviously\r\n"
"got an axe to grind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"But all of these so-called \"Reapers\" used to work for\r\n"
"the yakuza as hitmen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Hitmen... So we're talking professional killers here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Right. All we've been able to gather so far is that somebody\r\n"
"is organizing former yakuza hitmen to get some kind of\r\n"
"revenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "You think they want to wipe out the HLA?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"Well, not necessarily, seeing as they've also been harassing\r\n"
"active members of the Tojo Clan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"The HLA is going to have to do something about this.\r\n"
"We can't just lie down and take it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Is there anyone in the HLA who could take out these hitmen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, no, seeing as our members are former yakuza\r\n"
" who are trying to avoid that sort of thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Giusto..."

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"In any case, you just need someone to find these hitmen,\r\n"
"catch them, and round them all up, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "What are you implying...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"If I went after those guys, you could focus on helping your\r\n"
"HLA members turn their lives around. That's pretty\r\n"
"accurate, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Well, yes, but I couldn't ask something like that of you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"I myself left the yakuza to live an honest life. I know\r\n"
"how rough it can be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"And I know how important it is for you to honor\r\n"
"Kashiwagi-san's dying wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "I'll do anything I can to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Would you really do this for us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"I've got a lot of things going on right now, but I'll\r\n"
"definitely help out whenever I get the chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Oh... Thank you! Thank you so much!"
msgstr "Grazie! Grazie mille!"

msgctxt "784"
msgid "However can I thank you for doing this...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Save it for when this is all over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "So what exactly do you need me to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Let me think..."
msgstr "Fammi pensare..."

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"The HLA is using all its resources right now to collect\r\n"
"information on these Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Whenever it's convenient for you, please stop by, and I'll\r\n"
"give you all the info we've gathered on one of the hitmen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"And then, if you manage to find and capture that hitman,\r\n"
"give me a call, and we'll take it from there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"These men will be formidable opponents. You're better off\r\n"
"going after them only one at a time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Yeah, that sounds reasonable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"And for every hitman you successfully capture, the HLA\r\n"
"will offer you a reward, though I'm afraid it won't be much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "I'm not doing this for the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"But it wouldn't be right if we didn't at least cover\r\n"
"your expenses. Please. We insist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"Alright. I suppose I will need to spend time and money getting ready to take"
" them down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "I'll accept your reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Could I ask you one more thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "E cioè?"

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"These Reapers aren't just causing trouble for us here in\r\n"
"Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"They've been popping up all over the country, carrying out\r\n"
"attacks on other Tojo-affiliated families."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"At this stage, I'm afraid we don't have the resources\r\n"
"to do much outside of Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "But I seem to recall you saying you live in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"If we get any information on hitmen in Okinawa, do you\r\n"
"think you could head south and handle them, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid ""
"Sure, no problem. I don't know when I'll be back there next,\r\n"
"but definitely keep me in the loop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "All right. I'll reach out to you whenever we find something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"In any case, we can't shut these Reapers down for good\r\n"
"until we find out who's behind all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"It's going to be difficult, but with you on our side,\r\n"
"I know we can do this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr "Buona fortuna!"

